1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,060
If you want someone to do something and they're not doing it,

2
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:03,840
you have like four or five reasons that they're not doing it.

3
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:07,680
The first is they just didn't know that you wanted them to do it. Most common.

4
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:10,360
Hey, did you do that thing? And they're like, what thing? You're like, damn it.

5
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,880
I didn't write it down. Did I? So now I say, why didn't you do that thing? They

6
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:17,160
say, well, I didn't know how to do it. Okay. Now let's say we train them.

7
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,520
So I told you that you needed to do it. You know how to do it,

8
00:00:19,880 --> 00:00:23,320
but you didn't know when, oh, I need to do that tomorrow.

9
00:00:23,360 --> 00:00:27,720
The next is you have something that's blocking you. So I knew that I knew how,

10
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:30,880
I knew you wanted to do it tomorrow, but you also told me to do three other things.

11
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:35,080
Which one did you want me to do? Finally, you get into this,

12
00:00:35,080 --> 00:00:36,760
which is that I didn't want to do it,

13
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,560
which in my experience is the first place that we go to as entrepreneurs.

14
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:42,720
And typically the last one that's reality.

15
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:46,240
Most people I have found when they have a job prefer to keep it.

16
00:00:47,160 --> 00:00:49,720
And I've also found that most people prefer to feel like they're doing a good

17
00:00:49,720 --> 00:00:52,360
job at their job. It's usually one of these other issues.

